{"version":1,"key":"card:782","content":{"id":782,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"32c4a1b6-b92c-4ade-bc6d-4ef85c89d5d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当程序跑飞或者端口被占用时，我们常常用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"kill"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 把对应的进程结束掉。那输入 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"kill"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之后，进程身上究竟发生了什么？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"d01b2bf9-8190-4c1e-96d1-85c4da7b1173","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际上当输入 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"kill"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的时候，会给这个进程发送一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"SIGTERM(15)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的信号，"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":82,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"Shell 中使用 trap 捕获信号","refId":86,"collabId":"a866cca2-686e-47f9-a405-017f4f6b78eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个信号是可以被捕获或者丢弃的"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是说，进程不会被立即杀掉，进程可以捕获这个信号，收到信号后可以有序的清理资源，然后自行退出，这给了进程优雅退出的机会。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"0e1fea05-f733-42fa-b0b1-044e1ff7cd7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"kill"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并不能完全保证杀死进程，进程在捕获信号后，可以忽略，或者在退出时出现了意外卡死，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"kill"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还提供了一个选项 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-9"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来杀死进程，它也会发出一个信号 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"SIGKILL(9)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这个信号是不可以被捕获的，内核会直接终止进程，进程没有任何机会做清理，因此可能会留下临时文件、损坏的文件状态，子进程可能变为孤儿进程。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"082e6ff2-36dc-4d89-a49a-634e2f25cc0e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一种常见的信号也和退出进程有关，那就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"SIGINT(2)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，每次当我们在终端按下 "},{"type":"kbd","collabId":"3ec9d0d8-e755-4980-89f5-f30222d3332e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Ctrl + C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的时候会触发这个中断信号，这个信号同样是可以捕获的，因此很多 CLI 工具可以捕获该信号然后优雅退出。"}]}],"tags":["操作系统/进程管理/信号","命令/kill"],"createTime":1791950678475,"updateTime":1791951726919,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791951726919},"links":{"card:86":{"key":"card:86","type":"card","id":86}}}